 presenter:{body:'Combines Scout and Guide’s contributions, Vector’s calculations and Check’s evidence verdict into a concise takeaway for the selected audience, team, player and language.',tools:'Current synthetic evidence, the four specialist contributions and shared viewing preferences.',boundary:'Preserves the evidence cutoff and corrections. Agreement between roles is not proof of a tactical cause.'}
